   "wording": "Percent means \"out of 100\". To turn a decimal into a percentage, you need to multiply it by 100.",
   "wordingSha256": "f9c3f3f3272670ba4b35a3402ca5d9a17a26587add40d0be137bc58dbe4a2077",
